{"id":"n2-182","title":"～向け (〜muke)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Indicating target or intended audience.","longExplanation":"The ～向け grammar point is used to indicate the target or intended audience for a product, service, or event. It can be translated as 'for', 'aimed at', or 'intended for'.","formation":"Noun + 向け","examples":[{"jp":"この雑誌は若者向けです。","romaji":"Kono zasshi wa wakamono-muke desu.","en":"This magazine is aimed at young people.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雑誌","vocabId":"1299400","reading":"ざっし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"若者","vocabId":"1324350","reading":"わかもの"},{"surface":"向け","vocabId":"1277090","reading":"むけ"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"スーパーで家族向けの食品セットが売っています。","romaji":"Suupaa de kazoku-muke no shokuhin setto ga utte imasu.","en":"The supermarket sells food sets intended for families.","words":[{"surface":"スーパー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"家族","vocabId":"1192150","reading":"かぞく"},{"surface":"向け","vocabId":"1277090","reading":"むけ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食品","vocabId":"1358600","reading":"しょくひん"},{"surface":"セット","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"売っ","vocabId":"1473950","reading":"うる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"このアプリは初心者向けに作られています。","romaji":"Kono apuri wa shoshinsha-muke ni tsukurarete imasu.","en":"This application is designed for beginners.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"アプリ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"初心者","vocabId":"1342860","reading":"しょしんしゃ"},{"surface":"向け","vocabId":"1277090","reading":"むけ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作ら","vocabId":"1597890","reading":"つくる"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"